<title>POLAND: All Polish min T-bill prices fall at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish min T-bill prices fall at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at today's primary auction on total demand of 580 million zlotys against a 1.2 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p>  T-bill	    8-week  13-week  26-week  39-week  52-week</p>
<p>   new min price    --	94.88   90.07     --	 81.84</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)    --     (94.93) (90.14)    --	(81.96)</p>
<p>   new max price    --	95.00   90.18     --	 82.03</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)    --     (95.00) (90.23)    --	(83.04)</p>
<p>   offer		--	200.0   300.0     --	 700.0</p>
<p>   bids recorded    --	202.5   111.5     --	 266.4</p>
<p>   bids accepted    --	170.5    87.4     --	 179.2</p>
<p>   next auction     --	200.0   300.0     --	 500.0</p>
<p>NOTE. Offer and all bids in million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
